Package: abitools
Type: Package
Title: Detect When Installed R Packages Need to be Rebuilt
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jeroen", "Ooms", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jeroenooms@gmail.com")
Description: An installed R package may contain state copied from its
    dependencies at build time: compiled calls into the C API of a 'LinkingTo'
    package, S4 class definitions that extend classes from other packages, or
    copies of functions. When such a dependency changes, the binary package
    must be rebuilt. This package finds these critical dependencies and
    computes fingerprints of the parts that dependents copy, such that
    package repositories can rebuild exactly the packages that are affected
    by a change, rather than relying on version numbers.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/r-universe-org/abitools
